      "media_slot_id": "I.1.still.profield-4",
      "heading": "2 · Not a file format",
      "sentence": "JPEG and PNG are containers. They do not tell you what the image does in the world.",
      "quote": "To choose the right format is wisdom. To not choose at all is a 5MB hero image.",
