      "heading": "3 · Many genres at once",
      "sentence": "Editorial, advertising, beauty, portraiture, and documentary can all be fashion photography.",
      "quote": "Signifiers. Effective use of signifiers ensures discoverability and that the feedback is well communicated and intelligible.",
